{"id":"v1","level":4,"levelName":"The verb system","n":1,"of":8,"title":"What will happen","titleHe":"זְמַן עָתִיד","goal":"Use the future of pa'al, where the person is a prefix rather than an ending.","sections":[{"type":"text","body":"The past hangs its person on the end of the word. The future puts it on the front — א for I, ת for you and she, י for he, נ for we. Once you know those four letters you can read any future verb's person off its first letter."},{"type":"binyan","he":"פָּעַל","en":"pa'al (kal)","note":"The plain, basic verb — the one most everyday actions use.","verb":{"root":"כ־ת־ב","inf":"לִכְתֹּב","en":"to write"},"tense":"future","rows":[{"label":"I","he":"אֲנִי","form":"אֶכְתֹּב"},{"label":"you (m.)","he":"אַתָּה","form":"תִּכְתֹּב"},{"label":"you (f.)","he":"אַתְּ","form":"תִּכְתְּבִי"},{"label":"he","he":"הוּא","form":"יִכְתֹּב"},{"label":"she","he":"הִיא","form":"תִּכְתֹּב"},{"label":"we","he":"אֲנַחְנוּ","form":"נִכְתֹּב"},{"label":"you (m.pl.)","he":"אַתֶּם","form":"תִּכְתְּבוּ"},{"label":"you (f.pl.)","he":"אַתֶּן","form":"תִּכְתְּבוּ"},{"label":"they","he":"הֵם / הֵן","form":"יִכְתְּבוּ"}]},{"type":"tip","body":"ת does double duty: תִּכְתֹּב is both you (m.) will write and she will write. Only context or a pronoun tells them apart."},{"type":"examples","items":[{"he":"מָחָר אֶכְתֹּב מִכְתָּב.","en":"Tomorrow I'll write a letter."},{"he":"מָתַי תָּבוֹא?","en":"When will you come?"},{"he":"נִרְאֶה.","en":"We'll see."}]}],"vocab":[{"he":"מִכְתָּב","en":"letter","translit":"michtav"},{"he":"אוּלַי","en":"maybe","translit":"ulai"},{"he":"בְּוַדַּאי","en":"certainly","translit":"bevadai"},{"he":"אַחַר כָּךְ","en":"afterwards","translit":"achar kach"},{"he":"עוֹד","en":"more, still, another","translit":"od"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["two (m.)","letter","children","morning"],"correct":1,"prompt":"מִכְתָּב","translit":"michtav"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["me","sentence","maybe","ten (m.)"],"correct":2,"prompt":"אוּלַי","translit":"ulai"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["nevertheless","hears","certainly","misses, longs for"],"correct":2,"prompt":"בְּוַדַּאי","translit":"bevadai"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["afterwards","decides","I am not (literary)","and he saw"],"correct":0,"prompt":"אַחַר כָּךְ","translit":"achar kach"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["more, still, another","grandfather","king","excuse me, sorry"],"correct":0,"prompt":"עוֹד","translit":"od"},{"type":"choice","q":"write — you (m.), future","options":["תִּכְתֹּב","יִכְתֹּב","אֶכְתֹּב","תִּכְתְּבִי"],"correct":0,"he":true,"why":"פָּעַל, future: you (m.) is תִּכְתֹּב."},{"type":"choice","q":"write — you (m.pl.), future","options":["תִּכְתֹּב","תִּכְתְּבִי","תִּכְתְּבוּ","אֶכְתֹּב"],"correct":2,"he":true,"why":"פָּעַל, future: you (m.pl.) is תִּכְתְּבוּ."},{"type":"choice","q":"write — they, future","options":["תִּכְתְּבִי","אֶכְתֹּב","תִּכְתֹּב","יִכְתְּבוּ"],"correct":3,"he":true,"why":"פָּעַל, future: they is יִכְתְּבוּ."},{"type":"match","pairs":[["מִכְתָּב","letter"],["עוֹד","more, still, another"],["אוּלַי","maybe"],["אַחַר כָּךְ","afterwards"],["בְּוַדַּאי","certainly"]]},{"type":"listen","q":"Which word did you hear?","options":["אַחַר כָּךְ","עוֹד","בְּוַדַּאי","מִכְתָּב"],"correct":3,"say":"מִכְתָּב","he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “certainly”?","options":["עֵץ","בְּרָכָה","בְּוַדַּאי","כֹּל"],"correct":2,"he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “more, still, another”?","options":["שָׁלוֹם","כֹּחַ","בְּבַקָּשָׁה","עוֹד"],"correct":3,"he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"write — he, future","options":["תִּכְתְּבִי","יִכְתֹּב","אֶכְתֹּב","תִּכְתֹּב"],"correct":1,"he":true,"why":"פָּעַל, future: he is יִכְתֹּב."},{"type":"choice","q":"write — she, future","options":["תִּכְתֹּב","תִּכְתְּבִי","יִכְתֹּב","אֶכְתֹּב"],"correct":0,"he":true,"why":"פָּעַל, future: she is תִּכְתֹּב."},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “maybe”?","options":["לִי","מַכִּיר","אוּלַי","בֵּית חוֹלִים"],"correct":2,"he":true},{"type":"read","he":"בְּוַדַּאי","translit":"bevadai","en":"certainly"}]}